  "The case traces MPPA’s development from its establishment and listing to supermarkets, Hypermart, and Hyfresh. Its history also records a shift toward direct consumer retailing in 2018.": "Kasus menelusuri perkembangan MPPA dari pendirian dan pencatatan saham hingga supermarket, Hypermart, serta Hyfresh. Riwayatnya juga mencatat pergeseran menuju penjualan langsung ke konsumen pada 2018.",
