  "Source: Case 23, Exhibit 5, printed p. 590 · Approximate shares": "Sumber: Kasus 23, Eksibit 5, hlm. cetak 590 · Pangsa perkiraan",
  "Hypermart supplied approximately 85 percent of revenue in 2020. This shows its importance to MPPA, but revenue shares do not tell us which format is most profitable. That question belongs in the later analysis.": "Hypermart menyumbang sekitar 85 persen pendapatan pada 2020. Ini menunjukkan pentingnya Hypermart bagi MPPA, tetapi pangsa pendapatan tidak menentukan format paling menguntungkan. Pertanyaan tersebut dinilai dalam analisis berikutnya.",
  "Organizational structure": "Struktur organisasi",
