  "Do not rate this force high merely because e-commerce grew. Entrant scale, investment requirements and distribution access need evidence.": "Jangan menilai ancaman tinggi hanya karena e-commerce tumbuh. Skala pendatang, kebutuhan investasi dan akses distribusi memerlukan bukti.",
