  "A substitute meets the same underlying need in a different way; assess its relative price, performance and switching costs.": "Pengganti memenuhi kebutuhan dasar yang sama dengan cara berbeda; nilai harga relatif, manfaat dan biaya beralihnya.",
  "Our boundary includes supermarkets, minimarkets, traditional grocery shops and online grocery sellers. Switching among them is rivalry.": "Batas industri mencakup supermarket, minimarket, toko pangan tradisional dan penjual pangan daring. Perpindahan di antaranya termasuk persaingan.",
