  "Alfamidi identifies permits, sites, funding and staffing as operating barriers. Its franchise model also provides smaller operators access to brand and procurement support.": "Alfamidi mengidentifikasi izin, lokasi, pendanaan dan tenaga kerja sebagai hambatan operasi. Model waralabanya juga menyediakan akses dukungan merek dan pengadaan bagi operator kecil.",
  "MPPA operated three distribution centers with 76,952 pallet positions; merchandise flowing through them generated nearly 54% of store sales.": "MPPA mengoperasikan tiga pusat distribusi dengan 76.952 posisi palet; barang melalui pusat tersebut menghasilkan hampir 54% penjualan gerai.",
  "MPPA explicitly describes its established logistics network as a barrier to new retail entrants, including for serving Indonesia’s outer islands.": "MPPA secara eksplisit menyebut jaringan logistiknya sebagai hambatan bagi pendatang ritel baru, termasuk untuk melayani wilayah luar Jawa.",
